==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[The 6th Angel (Enemy)|The 6th Angel]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**4 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

